1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,060
Man: I'm considering taking up running to get in better shape. Do you run regularly?

2
00:00:09,060 --> 00:00:12,260
Woman: Yes, I do. It's a great way to stay fit.

3
00:00:12,260 --> 00:00:16,129
You should start with shorter distances and gradually increase.

4
00:00:16,129 --> 00:00:19,280
Man: That makes sense. Any tips for beginners?

5
00:00:19,280 --> 00:00:23,290
Woman: Yeah, make sure to mix up your running routine to keep it interesting.

6
00:00:23,290 --> 00:00:25,515
Man: Thanks, that's excellent advice.

7
00:00:25,515 --> 00:00:32,189
The weather is supposed to be great this weekend. I can't wait to get started.
